<title>HUNGARY: EGIS H1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT HUF 3.033 BL.</title>
<headline>EGIS H1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT HUF 3.033 BL.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-months to June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-June 1997    Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit		2,638.5    vs    3,025.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  3,032.6    vs    3,314.5</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		3,032.6    vs    3,314.5</p>
<p>    Net sales			13,592.9    vs   12,529.2</p>
<p>	Domestic sales		6,421.9    vs    7,288.8</p>
<p>	Export sales		  7,171.0    vs    5,240.4</p>
<p>    Other revenue		     536.3    vs	263.4</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	 4,511.2    vs    3,861.6</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales     6,215.5    vs    5,372.4</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    365.7 profit vs  300.7 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	     390.2    vs     343.6</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	  24.5    vs	42.9</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	 28.3 profit vs  11.2 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	  71.1    vs	 0.0</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure    42.7    vs	11.2</p>
<p>    Taxation				0.0    vs	 0.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Egis Gyogyszergyar Rt is a pharmaceuticals company, majority owned by France's Servier S.A. The figures were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
